{"ref":"BDB, יָשֵׁן³","hw":"יָשֵׁן³","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יָשֵׁן</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> one of David’s heroes, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:32\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.32\">2 S 23:32</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">הָשֵׁם</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:34\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.34\">1 Ch 11:34</a> (in both del. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי</span> as dittogr., We Dr Bu); v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, הָשֵׁם\" href=\"/BDB,_הָשֵׁם\", dir=\"rtl\">הָשֵׁם</a>, and <a data-ref=\"BDB, גּוּנִי\" href=\"/BDB,_גּוּנִי\", dir=\"rtl\">גוּנִי</a>.","next":"BDB, יָשָׁן","prev":"BDB, יָשֵׁן²"}